AB  - The genome sequence of multidrug-resistant <i>Raoultella terrigena</i> RT01-5M1 strain isolated from Canadian farmed salmon was determined using Oxford nanopore and Illumina MiSeq sequencers. The assembled chromosome was estimated at 5,699,993 bp in size, with two plasmids, 164,879 bp and 82,046 bp. The chromosome and smaller plasmid contained antimicrobial resistance genes.
